Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Hook,,0,0,0,,Stealing a Lambo from a mansion in GTA 6…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Wait. I don't want to leave ANYTHING behind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,(bleep)!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Oh (bleep), bro — now we have to RUN!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:14.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,If I don't run now, I lose it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:19.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,We're SCREWED!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:22.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,(bleep) (bleep) (bleep)!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:26.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,We're screwed — GET OUT, get out, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Oh bro — this car is FAST!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:44.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,This car is really fast — move, move, MOVE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:49.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,WOW. This car is SO fast, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:52.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Bro, DRIVE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:56.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?! Way TOO fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:59.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how it's driving.
